{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790868120, "covers_from": "2026-10-01T15:22:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-01T15:23:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790868180, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-01T15:22:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 55042, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "我想提問有關於禮讓行人的問題，是不是能夠將燈號分開，行人專用及車輛專用，如此分流這樣就不會造成危險，", "display_name": "南港代表 溫國國", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-01T15:22:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44502, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "我常看見北市的街道常換花，為什麼不能種四季較長的花朵呢？然後修剪樹木時，也應該先通知市民～謝謝", "display_name": "士林代表 No.44,502", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-01T15:22:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 1373, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "明明每天從士林到內湖車流那麼大，為什麼改成一個腳踏車道 一個停車格放在中間，是想要增加車禍或是塞車嗎", "display_name": "士林代表 No.1,373", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-01T15:22:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 41235, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "路邊停車亂象，沒有車位但卻買車也不承租公共停車場，巷子變擁擠", "display_name": "文山代表 No.41,235", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 44502, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.44,502", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 1373, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.1,373", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 41235, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.41,235", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 55043, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表